    "summary": "The daemon maps a forwarded client identity to the family whose cliKind it is (familyForClient in model-registry.ts) in the step host (which validates the client against the definitions' CLI kinds), one-shot analyze, code-review-rpc and workflow-rpc; step-context drops clientProviderKind/stepClientOf and the MCP server forwards only the client identity (detectClient). Attribution decodes labels by the shipped families' ids and CLI kinds before a model lookup. providers.listModels admits the registry's family ids, and its invalid-params text is the same whatever order the file lists the families in. claude.models answers from the Claude-kind family via claudeModels() (no Anthropic SDK REST call). OutputModelStamp.runner is FamilyId. The model-catalog-asset.test.ts repair that first landed in 165317970 is reverted for t6 (82c28bc22) and re-applied as t5's own fix (6abec29e1), so t6's net change no longer touches that file. The other session's concurrent edits to host.ts and step-context.ts were kept out of the commit.",
